{"kind": "finding", "id": "F-mission-groups-007-01", "file": "Source/Parsek.Tests/MissionLoiterKnobTests.cs", "line": 221, "method": "ScheduleK_NothingReachable_BoundedBestEarlierK", "category": "T3", "severity": "Medium", "confidence": "high", "falsifiability": "falsifiability: Source/Parsek/MissionPeriodicity.cs:1091; change the bounded-best tie-break to prefer the LATER k -> test stays green (k is only asserted InRange 1..2)", "what_it_asserts": "That the knob scan returns true, reports withinTolerance false and a residual above the 0.001 tolerance, with k inside [1,2] and d inside [-1,1].", "why_weak": "The InRange bounds are the scan window and the shift range, so they hold for every possible return value; the bounded-best selection and the ties-to-the-earlier-k rule the name claims are not pinned.", "proposed_action": "Replace the InRange asserts with the hand-checkable values for this geometry: k == 1, d == 1, residual == CircularPhaseError(1251, 633) (about 15 s), and add a mirror case where the later k is the bounded best.", "effort": "S", "july_ref": "none"}
